# Spider-Man, To the Rescue: "When Spider-Man enters, you may tap him. When you do, ..." Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills him
# with the ability on the stack, so there is nothing to tap and "when you do" has nothing to follow: Memnite does not
# gain indestructible.

